      },
      "rationale": "The effect that answers a focus request. It leaves the request alone unless the render's tree intent is later than the one the request recorded; it marks the request answered when such a render sees a new answer; while the subject is pending it returns, and a read that has ended failed or refused calls `revealUnavailableRead`, which reveals the status on the stacked layout without spending the request; a `scrollOnly` request waits until it is answered; then it clears the request and lands the focus.",
      "role": "primary-authority"
