      },
      "rationale": "Advances the walk with every answer the workspace shows and gives the rail the walked families. It computes two selection marks: for the rail among the walked families, so a kept family's row can carry the mark, and for the reading area among the answer's own families. While the subject is unanswered only the reader's explicit choice is marked, so the mark stays on the requested row. The cases \"keeps every row when a selected subject is refused, and starts afresh at the offer of the task context\" and \"keeps every row when the read of a selected subject fails\" of `dashboard/src/panels/review/ReviewSurface.walkFresh.test.tsx` test the unanswered states.",
      "role": "propagation-persistence"
    },
